	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Wire link for a single-sided milled board: two through-holes 14.50 mm apart, joined by an insulated wire on the component side. Used where a connection is provably unroutable on one copper layer -- the wire flies over the tracks that enclose it. Pads are 2.0 mm on a 0.8 mm drill, which suits 0.6 mm solid hookup wire and clears the 0.85 mm CNC rule against neighbouring copper.")
